        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>FEATURES</li><li>Stunning period family home from the Victorian era circa 1870</li><li>Awash with period features to include tall ceilings with detailed cornicing, original tiling and feature fireplaces</li><li>Set on 0.53 acres of magnificent landscaped gardens with its own orchard</li><li>Detached double garage and 2nd detached garage with rear laneway access</li><li>Potential to substantially extend the existing accommodation or to develop 5 new homes (subject to P.P.)</li><li>Prime residential location with a short stroll of the quaint village of Monkstown</li><li>Choice of well regarded primary & secondary schools in the nearby vicinity</li><li>Short walk to the DART and several bus routes</ul>"
